---
---

<section class="section workspace" id="workspace">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="intro reveal">
      <h2 class="h-section">A terminal in the current folder.</h2>
      <p class="lede">Press F4 for a built-in terminal powered by Ghostty’s terminal core. Inspect a file above, run a command below.</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="terminal reveal">
      <div class="frame">
        <video controls playsinline preload="none" poster="/media/s/workflow-terminal.webp" aria-label="HyprFM opening its terminal with F4 and running git status --short">
          <source src="/media/l/terminal.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
          <p><a href="/media/l/terminal.mp4">Watch the built-in terminal demo.</a></p>
        </video>
      </div>
      <figcaption><kbd>F4</kbd> opens the shell. <code>git status --short</code> runs in the same project. Nine seconds, recorded in the real app.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="git reveal">
      <div class="git-copy">
        <h3>Git status, at a glance.</h3>
        <p>Staged or untracked? Status overlays mark the files, and the detailed view’s Git column spells it out.</p>
        <a href="/media/s/workflow-git.webp" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open the full screenshot ↗</a>
      </div>
      <figure>
        <div class="frame git-detail"><img src="/media/s/workflow-git-detail.webp" alt="HyprFM’s detailed view showing staged README.md, dashboard.css and server.go files, with other files marked untracked" width="1240" height="270" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <figcaption>A closer look at the Git column in the captured demo workspace.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .intro { display: grid; gap: 20px; max-width: 850px; margin-bottom: 36px; }
  .intro .lede { max-width: 65ch; }
  figure { margin: 0; display: grid; gap: 16px; min-width: 0; }
  .terminal .frame { aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; }
  figcaption { font-size: 14px; color: var(--subtext); }
  kbd, code { color: var(--text); font-size: .9em; }
  .git { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 2fr); gap: 32px; align-items: center; margin-top: 48px; }
  .git-copy { display: grid; gap: 14px; }
  h3 { font: 600 22px/1.3 var(--display); letter-spacing: -.025em; }
  .git-copy p { font-size: 15.5px; color: var(--subtext); }
  .git-copy a { font-size: 14px; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
  .git-detail { border-radius: 10px; }
  .git-detail > img { height: auto; }
  @media (max-width: 768px) { .git { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 24px; } }
</style>
